      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "How do I reset my password?",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 68,
          "startingLine": 38
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "On the sign-in screen tap “Forgot password?”, choose SMS or email, enter the 6-digit code and set a new password.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 39,
          "startingLine": 39
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Can I see more than one child in the app?",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 68,
          "startingLine": 40
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Yes. Every student linked to your mobile number appears in the student switcher on Home. Tap it to switch.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 39,
          "startingLine": 41
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "My fee payment isn’t showing as paid",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 65,
          "startingLine": 42
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Online payments update within a few minutes. For bank transfer or DD, upload the payment proof under Fees; the accounts office verifies it, usually within 2 working days.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 39,
          "startingLine": 43
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Attendance is marked wrong — what should I do?",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 71,
          "startingLine": 44
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Open Raise a concern, choose Attendance and mention the date and subject. Your class mentor will review it.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 39,
          "startingLine": 45
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Can I reply to a voice message?",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 69,
          "startingLine": 46
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Yes. Open the conversation and hold the microphone button to record a reply, or type a text message.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 39,
          "startingLine": 47
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "How do I turn on Face ID or fingerprint sign-in?",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 68,
          "startingLine": 48
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Sign in once with your password on this phone. Quick sign-in turns on automatically, and you can switch it off in Profile › Notification settings.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 39,
          "startingLine": 49
        }
      },
      {
